Refs #1385. The title animation landed with two scenes, the Kali fold and the echo rings (#1408). The owner picked the scenes to keep from the twelve fields of the exploration:

> My favorites are A1, A2, A3, A6, A7, A10, A12. Keep all of them. Keep but refine/fix A8, A11

This is A3, the `solid` scene. Without it the draw cannot pick it, and `console.titleWeights` refuses its name.

